OL,5,G0245 The Wild Ride
OL,6,     F1960. Director: Harvey Berman.
OL,7,     FStars Jack Nicholson, Georgianna
OL,8,     FCarter & Robert Bean. A rebellious
OL,9,     Fpunk spends his days partying and
OL,10,     Ftroublemaking until life catches
OL,11,     Fup with him.
OL,12,G0400 The Directors
OL,13,     FJohn Ford is known for his
OL,14,     Fvisually powerful westerns with
OL,15,     Fhis characters framed against
OL,16,     FAmerica's stunning natural
OL,17,     Flandmarks. His four Academy Awards
OL,18,     Ffor Best Director remain a record.
